  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">With the event Révélations, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/dom-p%C3%A9rignon-official?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Dom Pérignon</a> opens a window onto the inspirations, artistic dialogues and craftsmanship that shape the Maison.
 
At the heart of the 2026 edition was the presentation of Dom Pérignon Vintage 2018, the first vintage crafted entirely under the direction of Chef de Cave Vincent Chaperon. Born from an exceptionally generous year in Champagne, the wine expresses a remarkable sense of harmony and fullness, reflecting the balance that lies at the heart of every Dom Pérignon creation.
 
The theme of this year’s edition, “Place”, explores the profound influence of terroir, landscape and environment on the creation of a wine.
 
Conceived as an immersive expression of this theme and the Maison’s universe, the evening unfolded through House of Gestures, a performance at Bilbao Guggenheim Museum co-created by Tilda Swinton and Olivier Saillard. Inspired by Dom Pérignon, the work explored the dialogue between body, gesture and memory, transforming space into a living landscape shaped by emotion, presence and time.

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Flvmh&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#LVMH</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2FdompAezrignon&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#DomPérignon</a></p>
<!---->  </div>



        

        
            
      
    
    
    

