  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary"><a class="link" href="https://fr.linkedin.com/company/christian-dior-couture?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Christian Dior Couture</a> unveils its Summer 2027 Men’s Show, with music by Fred again.., producer, songwriter, multi-instrumentalist and DJ.
 
Sampling and remixing carve out new meaning for what’s known, transforming the familiar, magnifying the subtle and refreshing character.
The Summer 2027 Men’s Collection performs similar sleights of hand: skewing conventions, juxtaposing ideas from different eras and replicating what already exists in unexpected ways.
 
An exercise in shifting perspectives, reinvention and the euphoria of recognition.
 
<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Flvmh&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#LVMH</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fdior&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Dior</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fdiorsummer27&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#DiorSummer27</a>

Credits: FINALE BY ADRIEN DIRAND</p>
