    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary"><a class="link" href="https://fr.linkedin.com/company/kenzo-paris?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>KENZO Mode</a> unveils its Spring-Summer 2027 Men’s and Women’s Collection, as Artistic Director Nigo returns to Place des Victoires, the historic Parisian square where founder Kenzo Takada opened his legendary flagship boutique in 1976.
 
Fifty years later, the square inspires a collection built around encounters and contrasts. Drawing on the Maison’s archives, Ivy League references, romantic ribbon details and contemporary sportswear codes, Nigo reinterprets the spirit of KENZO through a wardrobe that celebrates individuality, freedom and self-expression.
 
Inspired by Kenzo Takada’s enduring optimism, the collection brings past and present together through craftsmanship, innovation and a shared belief that “le monde est beau.”
 
<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Flvmh&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#LVMH</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fkenzo&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Kenzo</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fkenzoss27&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#KENZOSS27</a></p>
